{
  "_readme": [
    "The outlet roster. 'lean' is one of: left, lean-left, center, lean-right, right.",
    "Leans are starter values that approximate the consensus of public media-bias raters (AllSides, Ad Fontes Media, Media Bias/Fact Check). Review and adjust them; they are not gospel.",
    "Each feed is either a plain URL (a news feed) or { \"url\": ..., \"kind\": \"opinion\" } for a feed that is mostly commentary. Opinion feeds never count as news coverage; they only feed the balanced Perspectives section.",
    "Two rosters must each mirror themselves: outlets with a news feed, and outlets with an opinion feed. Same number of 'left' as 'right', and of 'lean-left' as 'lean-right'. Run `npm run check:balance` after any edit; the build refuses to run if either is lopsided.",
    "Feeds were last verified live on 2026-11-12. Run `npm run check:feeds` to re-test them."
  ],
